    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93561" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σειρήνειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Siren-like</i>: metaph.,
				<i>bewitching</i>, <i><span class="en">
