				<u>4 Ma.</u>
				15.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				5.1
			</span></i>:—in codd. freq. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειρήνιος</span>. Also fem. Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σειρηνίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
